{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a &quot;Neo-2D Action Puzzle Game&quot; that places a 2D game on a 3D surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Operate your character skillfully and use four types of items to solve the map's tricks,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find the stage exit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Since the 2D map is connected three dimensionally, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">you may not be able to go where you want to go or find an unexpected path. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this way, it has become an action game with a feel like never before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The direction of gravity changes depending on the player's position on 2D, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">and this is reflected in the entire 3D, so making this game a puzzle that tests the player's 3D sense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3546020?t=1743824961","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3546020?t=1743824961","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546020/14efba988473ff2e160124a8f993aa71ad6f0783/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743824961","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546020/14efba988473ff2e160124a8f993aa71ad6f0783/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743824961","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a &quot;Neo-2D Action Puzzle Game&quot; that places a 2D game on a 3D surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Operate your character skillfully and use four types of items to solve the map's tricks,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find the stage exit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Since the 2D map is connected three dimensionally, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">you may not be able to go where you want to go or find an unexpected path. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this way, it has become an action game with a feel like never before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The direction of gravity changes depending on the player's position on 2D, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">and this is reflected in the entire 3D, so making this game a puzzle that tests the player's 3D sense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Hiroyuki Sasayama"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546020/header.jpg?t=1743824961","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 15.3.1<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 60 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 15.3.1<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 60 MB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257118927,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257118927/movie480.mp4?t=1743041973","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257118927/movie_max.mp4?t=1743041973"},"name":"stage15_draft1","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257118927/027bb572901f4ab830b2ac4c8df9bc1b431515a2/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1743041973","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257118927/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1743041973","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257118927/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1743041973"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257118926,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257118926/movi